<para>In a real CUDA implementation this calls <computeroutput>cudaMemset(ptr, 0, slab_size)</computeroutput> before returning the slab to the free list, preventing one tenant from reading another tenant&apos;s data. In the bookkeeping-only simulation the flag increments a counter that is visible in <ref refid="structthemis_1_1gpu_1_1_g_p_u_memory_pool_1_1_stats" kindref="compound">Stats</ref>. </para>
